43	 * Collects player information including first name, last name, email, and an optional introducer.
44	 * Upon submission, sends a welcome email to the new player and displays notifications for success or failure.
45	 *
46	 * @param props - Component props
47	 * @param props.players - Array of existing players used to populate the "Introduced by" dropdown
